    "muse": {
      "title": "The muse",
      "sub": "What Phipal is for a business in the Phiegg ecosystem.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "prose",
          "title": "Payments with a brain",
          "body": "PayPal moved money; Phipal moves money with intent. Every transfer belongs to a strategy: a bid it funds, a stake it feeds, a listing it clears. A club running a drop does not watch dashboards; it tells Phipal the target and the limits, and the agents bid, price and settle inside them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "prose",
          "title": "Game theory, not gambling",
          "body": "The marketplace is a repeated game with visible moves: minted counts, holders, volume, the change log. Phipal prices every move by expected value, assumes the other players do too, and prefers positions that stay good when everyone plays well. Limits are hard: it stops at your ceiling, never above it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "stats",
          "title": "The four strategies",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "Hold",
              "value": "EV+",
              "sub": "Scarce records near sell-out"
            },
            {
              "label": "Bid",
              "value": "Under floor",
              "sub": "Offers the seller should take"
            },
            {
              "label": "Swap",
              "value": "Ahead of need",
              "sub": "The coin the next move wants"
            },
            {
              "label": "Stake",
              "value": "Spread",
              "sub": "Pools by yield and traffic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "prose",
          "title": "For business",
          "body": "A maison plugs Phipal into its own drops: it clears offers, settles orders with the checkout steps, stakes the proceeds and reports each move. The specs, tasks and calls of every agent are records in the one database (kind agentSpec), so your systems read the same source the agents run on."
        }
      ]
    },
