          "kind": "prose",
          "title": "Pull once, run everywhere",
          "body": "Phient pulls models to Phinet nodes the way a container runtime pulls images: pinned, versioned, local. Every agent call in the ecosystem routes to the nearest warm model, and nothing leaves the network. The /chat endpoint the apps already use is Phient's front door."
        },
        {
          "kind": "terminal",
          "title": "",
          "lines": [
            "phient 0.9 on phinet-node-03",
            "3 models warm · 2 nodes idle"
          ],
          "commands": {
            "phient pull strategist": [
              "pulling strategist:latest",
              "verifying layers",
              "pinned on phinet-node-03"
            ],
            "phient run strategist": [
              "strategist ready",
              "> price the Calla drop under 2,000 USD",
              "hold until minted 4 of 5, then bid 1,840"
            ],
            "phient ps": [
              "strategist  warm  node-03",
              "appraiser   warm  node-01",
              "signer      warm  node-07"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "title": "Phient calls",
          "cols": [
            "Method",
            "Path",
            "What"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "POST",
              "/chat",
              "Run a model"
            ],
            [
              "GET",
              "/health",
              "Runtime health"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "phiecs": {
      "title": "Phiecs",
      "sub": "The robotics platform: the same strategies, on real floors.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "prose",
          "title": "Embodied agents",
          "body": "A Phiecs unit is a Phipal plan with wheels: it reads the Phinet fleet, thinks on Phient models, and executes plan steps in ateliers and warehouses. Every action streams back into the one database as log records, the same audit trail the marketplace agents leave."
        },
        {
          "kind": "grid",
          "title": "What a unit uses",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "Phinet",
              "sub": "The fleet",
              "body": "Nodes, endpoints and the firewall: where a unit may act.",
              "image": "phiegg:worlds/w_couture_coast.png",
              "genImage": true
            },
            {
              "title": "Phient",
              "sub": "The mind",
